# A plate linked, regenerated in its configuration "long" and passed L
# = 60 from its group screen, then relinked to a block; the same as
# path_link_params.go makes (TestPathEquivalenceLinkParams). An empty
# model beside the parts is opened first, so that the screen names them
# relative to it, the same on every machine.
file $testdata/linkparams/host.tlspr
menu File|Open...
file $testdata/linkparams/plate.tlspr
menu Assembly|Link / Assemble...
twmove 366 170
twdown L 366 170
twup L 366 170
twmove 258 190
twdown L 258 190
twup L 258 190
edit 60
file $testdata/linkparams/block.tlspr
twmove 186 130
twdown L 186 130
twup L 186 130
